{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1000_p", "source_sha256": "691dada6730cb04ea9f34b474fe291fc6880f4c22942fa877f4829e465d1632f", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n茜もパジャマに着替え、準備万端だ！）", "zh": "（今天要为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄。\n茜也换上了睡衣，万事俱备！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "06a162aeed5e3fa929f415035dd44f447d586a625202a649051681f8b1e23149", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、どうしよう！？\n大ピンチだよ～！　『アレ』が！　『アレ』が……！", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办呀！？\n大危机啊～！“那个”！“那个”它……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7350cd2ae9e791be0af0624102d2613657e19e160f6685892d00afa4ff7c0ad8", "ja": "『アレ』？　一体、『アレ』がどうしたんだ？", "zh": "“那个”？“那个”到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "e599015dcb00b7f0c23c7dd82ff96cd5aaec07be5f62218bcc7a432fea0b1e96", "ja": "足りないんだよ～！　『アレ』はね、この衣装の良さと\n茜ちゃんのカワイさを引き出す重要アイテムなのにっ！", "zh": "还缺着呢～！“那个”可是能衬托出这套服装的优点和小茜的可爱之处的重要道具啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4d60985cb5a7ca31810fe642c5426969dc3a145b02eb75f7e8536e01e796f241", "ja": "なんだってー！？\nすぐ準備するから『アレ』がなんなのか教えてくれ！", "zh": "什么——！？\n我这就去准备，快告诉我“那个”到底是什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "486df47d0c9983bfe4d06e9527b4a09c1da1acbf16bbc03876e8041a8eccd3d6", "ja": "さすが{$P$}ちゃん！\nなら、懐中電灯を大至急お願い！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}！\n那就拜托你赶紧拿手电筒来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e46a9af1abebbf5c55d45e37ffd469d11b6f4d1d25608f2b4d83afcb1497da98", "ja": "懐中電灯……？　何に使うんだ？", "zh": "手电筒……？要拿来做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "9199fb6afec6f7356d72fd7b6c06f988b42db9791af9911dc71078028db3f32e", "ja": "ええっ！？　わからないの！？　……見てよ。\nこのパジャマ、すっごくカワイイでしょ？", "zh": "诶！？你不知道吗！？……你看嘛。\n这身睡衣，超级可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "31d4eb77d8e26ae72261bff4f045955876947b27787a0d75d3ec7b5b3461c6aa", "ja": "こんなにキュートなパジャマ姿の茜ちゃんが\n懐中電灯を持ってすることと言えば怪談しかないよ！", "zh": "穿着这么可爱睡衣的小茜，拿着手电筒还能做什么？当然只能讲鬼故事啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5d812084f9be48194ca4cbb07f52c0f637f62aecc86de263d1ba1f40a7bdcfb6", "ja": "……なるほど？", "zh": "……原来如此？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "0a9ef0e4bf4b5e31ccf5175a0eaf1cba8ce2ff7601d81f4f00176f31a71fab89", "ja": "目を閉じて、想像してみるのです……。\n怖い話にプルプル震える、可憐な茜ちゃんの姿を。", "zh": "闭上眼睛，想象一下吧……\n想象可爱的、被恐怖故事吓得瑟瑟发抖的小茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c3d9e0bbcf1cbd5fc218508ce94afd4bc267a0f92d7e2bee271c7edeb46e743", "ja": "どう？　最高にグッとくるでしょ？\n茜ちゃんの新しい魅力に、気づいちゃったでしょ？", "zh": "怎么样？是不是特别让人心动？\n你也发现了小茜的新魅力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5277be55c373c4cd8bcee45bee152bb3d90a51d07c0f6012017bdf231c84853a", "ja": "そうだな。……でも、写真だとその茜のカワイさを\nみんなには伝えきれないと思うんだ。", "zh": "是啊。……不过，光靠照片，我觉得还是没法把茜的可爱完全传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "395a3bed59eb7cda86e3c6b9968710f6c68f23eab12f05601e6a3ac56b425fc6", "ja": "にゃにゃっ！？　そ、それは……！", "zh": "喵喵！？　这、这是什么意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c21ecb8e054f38e7aaa1eab0d7c74e82bc98aea61a92473171fa5ee1a22d6db7", "ja": "でも、そのパジャマが、既に茜の魅力を引き出してる\nからな。茜はそのままでも十分だと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，那身睡衣已经把茜的魅力展现出来了\n所以我觉得茜保持现在这样就已经很棒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "31b6f4f958a39d97e4a76e57fda1a3937783efa30860b96055644f1508698f35", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。\n茜ちゃんのこと、そんな風に考えてたなんて……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n没想到你竟然是这么看待小茜的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "9d3a9636bca4bb3e0dcc5ee8ebbab4701a462fcf26bc370cbcb2440eea3885a5", "ja": "でも安心して！　こんなこともあろうかと\nプランBも用意してるから☆　ニャ～ッハッハ～！", "zh": "不过放心吧！为了以防万一，B计划也准备好了☆喵哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0503_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0503_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e2f0a3a8458d1d96324e2bb4a6272b8d60f365f2d4059d89806dba5776b4386e", "ja": "（撮影は無事終了。スタッフさんからも好評だったが\n……プランBもなかなか攻めた内容だったな）", "zh": "（拍摄顺利结束。工作人员也赞不绝口，不过……B计划的内容还真是够大胆的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
